  Vehicles: []
  event2survivor:
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "I told you, we should\u2019ve hit the pharmacy first. We can\u2019t survive
      on canned beans forever."
    - "Pharmacy\u2019s too risky. There\u2019s that horde near the street corner.
      We stick to the supermarket and hope for the best."
    - "Hey! Who\u2019s there? You\u2026 you\u2019re not one of them, are you?"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "Did anyone hear from Marcus? He went out before sunrise\u2026 he never comes
      back this late."
    - "Let\u2019s not panic yet. He knows these streets better than anyone\u2026
      probably found something useful."
    - "Wait\u2026 you! Where did you come from?"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors:
    - {fileID: 7441000921677630084, guid: 5b34f23181d08d445b469f08095c62fe, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 1042544255454963484, guid: 9ce01d2208b8a5f46a6fc3bae6346d0c, type: 3}
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 14
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "You\u2019re reckless! You can\u2019t just wander into that street full of
      deads!"
    - "And you\u2019re cowardly! If we don\u2019t take risks, we starve. Simple as
      that."
    - "Uh\u2026 you there! Step back! Are you\u2026 alone?"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "Remember life before\u2026 before all this? Feels like a dream now."
    - "Yeah\u2026 dreams you\u2019d rather forget. Now all we have is tonight, and
      maybe tomorrow."
    - "Hey! Who\u2019s out there?! Don\u2019t sneak up on us like that!"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "I heard there\u2019s a building on 5th that\u2019s safe\u2026 untouched. No
      zombies, no raiders."
    - Stop repeating rumors. Every building has a story. Some dead, some worse.
    - "Hold on\u2026 who\u2019s that? Don\u2019t come closer!"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "I found some food in that abandoned house. Should we\u2026 share it with the
      others?"
    - "Or hoard it. Only the strong survive. That\u2019s the law now."
    - "Wait\u2026 who\u2019s there? Are you armed?"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors:
    - {fileID: 3816641826279779961, guid: 71d2c79699aa9964a9969210235f8fd1, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 4536060065368327761, guid: 23e27d685fe3eb4468fab7cdc1912a20, type: 3}
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - We need to get across the river. The bridge might be clear at night.
    - "Night\u2019s riskier. They move slower, but we move slower too. Still, no
      choice."
    - Stop! Who goes there? Show yourself!
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "I\u2026 I saw them. Our kids\u2026 I thought they were alive. But\u2026"
    - "\u2026don\u2019t say it. Don\u2019t remind me. We\u2019ve lost too much already."
    - "Someone\u2019s here\u2026"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "I can trade you two cans for a medkit. No way I\u2019m giving more."
    - "Fine, but next time don\u2019t think you can cheat me. Resources are scarce,
      but trust matters too."
    - "Hey! Who are you? Looking to trade, or\u2026 trouble?"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "Something\u2019s off. The usual groans\u2026 they\u2019re quieter. Too quiet."
    - "Yeah\u2026 like they\u2019re waiting. Or worse, watching."
    - "Who\u2019s there?! Show yourself! Don\u2019t make me regret asking!"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - That stash is mine!
    - No, I found it first!
    - "Uh\u2026 hey, you. Don\u2019t get in the middle of this."
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors:
    - {fileID: 4432471361555323814, guid: b1a988c7d6962324997e82b89131bcc0, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 3816641826279779961, guid: 71d2c79699aa9964a9969210235f8fd1, type: 3}
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
