    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 13
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "I used to sit in the park\u2026 watch the sun on the swings, kids laughing.
      Can\u2019t remember if I smiled back then."
    - "It\u2019s cruel, remembering happiness when all we see now is decay."
    - "Uh\u2026 hey, don\u2019t sneak up like that."
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "That trader yesterday\u2026 he looked fine, but something felt off."
    - Trust no one. People are worse than the dead.
    - "Hey\u2026 who\u2019s that? You with him or alone?"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "If the bridge collapses, we\u2019re trapped. We need another route\u2026 maybe
      sewers, but worse things than walkers lurk there."
    - "Yeah\u2026 but staying isn\u2019t an option either. Hunger, sickness\u2026
      we can\u2019t wait."
    - "Wait! Who\u2019s out there?! Don\u2019t move too fast!"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - We should follow Mia. She knows how to survive.
    - Or we die following her plan! My gut says otherwise.
    - "Uh\u2026 hey, wait! Who are you?"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "Tom won\u2019t make it without this medkit."
    - "We barely have enough\u2026"
    - "Hey! Who\u2019s there?"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "I remember Saturday mornings\u2026 cartoons on TV, pancakes, and nobody worrying
      about whether they\u2019d survive the day."
    - "Yeah\u2026 my sister used to hide in my bed, pretending the world outside
      wasn\u2019t there. Now\u2026"
    - "Now\u2026 every sound could be the last one we hear."
    - "Hey\u2026 wait\u2026 who\u2019s there?"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "I think they\u2019re coming."
    - Barricade! Fast!
    - "Hey\u2026 wait\u2026 who\u2019s there?"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "I\u2019ve got a few beans\u2026 want some?"
    - "Half? That\u2019s risky\u2026 you\u2019ll starve."
    - Better to share a little than hoard it all.
    - "Wait\u2026 who\u2019s that? You looking for food too?"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors:
    - {fileID: 7441000921677630084, guid: 5b34f23181d08d445b469f08095c62fe, type: 3}
