    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 7
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "Be careful in the alley\u2026 someone set spikes. Not walkers. I saw a kid
      get caught last week. Never walked the same again."
    - "Yeah\u2026 people are worse than the decayed. You gotta watch everything."
    - "Wait\u2026 who\u2019s that? You looking for food too?"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "My little brother\u2026 he loved drawing. I left his sketches on the fridge.
      Don\u2019t even know if the house is still there."
    - "I remember my sister used to hide in closets, thinking it would keep her safe.
      Didn\u2019t work."
    - "Wait\u2026 who\u2019s that? Don\u2019t come any closer!"
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors: []
    Vehicles: []
    LootableObjects: []
    ShowChoiceButtonAtEndOfDialouge: 1
    DialougeChangeFrequency: 1
    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "I stayed up all night once\u2026 thought I heard something scratching at the
      door. Turned out to be just the wind\u2026 or maybe not. I can\u2019t tell
      anymore."
    - "I\u2019d rather face the decayed than face that silence. Makes your mind play
      tricks."
    - "Uh\u2026 hey. Who\u2019s there? Don\u2019t sneak up on us."
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    Survivors:
    - {fileID: 750897079123205016, guid: 908ae7e899b4cb248932d53b80b27382, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 7441000921677630084, guid: 5b34f23181d08d445b469f08095c62fe, type: 3}
