    PrimaryChoiceType: 0
    AllowRetreat: 1
    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "I hate night\u2026 it\u2019s like the world forgets you exist. Silence, shadows,
      and the groans too far to track."
    - "Whoa! Who\u2019s there?! Don\u2019t move too fast."
