    NPCLevel: 1
  - SurvivorCount: 2
    dialouge:
    - "We found them in the street\u2026 family of three. Thought we were alone for
      a minute\u2026 but then\u2026"
    - "I don\u2019t want to remember. My own memories are enough."
    - I still see their faces when I close my eyes.
    - "Uh\u2026 hey! Who\u2019s that?"
