    dialouge:
    - "We used to hide in the old subway tunnels\u2026 made a little home. Someone
      found us once, but they left. We were lucky."
    - "Lucky or na\xEFve. Most people would\u2019ve killed us for food."
    - "I still sleep with one eye open. Can\u2019t trust anyone\u2026 not really."
    - "Whoa\u2026 who\u2019s there?! Don\u2019t move."
